    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tr_mask_t",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 2372,
      "text": "Only masked text reaches a model.\nevidence.json, transcript.jsonl and screen.jsonl are masked when written.\ntrace.jsonl, the pictures and voice.m4a never go to a model.\nThe one exception: with Pictures on, the blacked-out pictures\ngo to the vision model for captions.",
