      "id": "b7f_t",
      "x": 3144,
      "y": 1662,
      "text": "7f FINISH GATE (code)\nrefuses \"done\" while:\n· work you showed is gone\n· a rule you said isn't built\n· a check uses text that\n  never appeared on screen\n· a test failure is unexplained\n· how often doesn't match\nAfter 2 refusals it saves\nwith the gaps listed",
