    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p8_n1",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 2908,
      "text": "v1.json: the workflow. Each change makes v2, v3…; none is overwritten\nreview.json: each change's badge and reason, what you said → what was\n  built, what wasn't tested, the gaps\nmeta.json: saved at. The recordings/<id>/ folder is deleted 24 h later",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
